{"ref":"BDB, סֶ֫לֶף","hw":"סֶ֫לֶף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סֶ֫לֶף</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.3\">Pr 11:3</a></sup> Qr <strong>crookedness, crooked dealing</strong>:—<span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.4\">Pr 15:4</a> (of tongue); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳ בֹּגְדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.3\">11:3</a>.","next":"BDB, סָלֵק","prev":"BDB, סָלַף"}